Last night I finally ascended a Priestess, the role I've had the most
trouble with, on nethack.alt.org.  This makes at least one ascension
with each Role, Race, Gender, and Alignment.

I started with a spellbook of Identify, so that made everything much
smoother.  I was especially careful throughout, so I didn't have any
close calls, really.  Astral was probably the toughest I've ever seen
it -- I had to visit all three altars, and I was deeply surrounded
most of the time.

Of note: this ascension was on 3.4.3, like all of my other
ascensions.  The first one was three and a half years ago.  I believe
it's been right at four years now since any new code was released from
the DevTeam.  Are they still with us?




